
This directory contains the configure and makefile that was shipped with
Oratcl 2.3, which supported Tcl 7.4  If you are still using Tcl 7.4, this
configure and makefile might help you.  I've hacked the Oracle searching
routines to include Oracle 7.3

See the shell script 'run.configure'.  It lists all of the configure options
for this version.  It also copies the files needed to build oratcl to this
directory.

Good luck.

Tom Poindexter

